<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS1" title="In 5 Experiments ‣ Enabling Large Language Models to Generate Text with Citations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.1 </span>Main Results</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS1.SSS0.Px1" title="In 5.1 Main Results ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ Enabling Large Language Models to Generate Text with Citations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_smallcaps">Vanilla</span> achieves strong performance.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS1.SSS0.Px2" title="In 5.1 Main Results ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ Enabling Large Language Models to Generate Text with Citations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Using summaries or snippets improves correctness.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS1.SSS0.Px3" title="In 5.1 Main Results ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ Enabling Large Language Models to Generate Text with Citations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Retrieving text on the fly does not improve performance.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS1.SSS0.Px4" title="In 5.1 Main Results ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ Enabling Large Language Models to Generate Text with Citations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Rerank</span> boosts citation quality.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS1.SSS0.Px5" title="In 5.1 Main Results ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ Enabling Large Language Models to Generate Text with Citations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">ClosedBook</span>+<span class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">PostCite</span> delivers strong correctness but poor citation quality.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS1.SSS0.Px6" title="In 5.1 Main Results ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ Enabling Large Language Models to Generate Text with Citations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">GPT-4 brings limited improvement but is better at using long context.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
