Instruction for <span id="A8.T23.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Vanilla</span>.
</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A8.T24" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A8.T24.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A8.T24.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A8.T24.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb ltx_border_tt">
<span id="A8.T24.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="A8.T24.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A8.T24.2.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Instruction: Write a high-quality answer for the given question using only the provided search results and cite them properly using [1][2][3].</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
