<span id="A8.T27.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A8.T27.2.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Instruction: Write an accurate, engaging, and concise answer for the given question using only the provided search results and cite them properly. Use an unbiased and journalistic tone. Always cite for any factual claim.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A8.T27.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A8.T27.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A8.T27.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
