<span id="A9.T31.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A9.T31.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF8000;"> 2. Introducing ads too early can deter potential users.</span></span>
</span></span></td></tr>
<tr id="A9.T31.2.16" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A9.T31.2.16.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb"><span id="A9.T31.2.16.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_align_top" style="width:338.1pt;">
<span id="A9.T31.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_align_left ltx_noindent">
<span id="A9.T31.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A9.T31.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF8000;"> 3. Uber is reinvesting a lot of money to make their service better.</span></span>
